<title>UK: IADB sets $180 million four-year bond.</title>
<headline>IADB sets $180 million four-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by joint lead managers New Japan and IBJ.</p>
<p> BORROWER   INTER-AMERICAN DEVELOPMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT    $180 MLN	COUPON     5.5	 MATURITY    19.DEC.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    19.DEC.96</p>
<p>FULL FEES  1.10  </p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    NONE	PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS US/UK/JP</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    =	   HOME CTRY  SUPRA     TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF AN EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
